cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Artifice OCR"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, bring-your-own-model (BYOM) pipeline for historical document
  OCR, cleanup, and translation, built around a structured model-interaction
  harness rather than a freeform chat interface. Runs against a local LLM
  server (Ollama, LM Studio, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint) so documents
  never leave the researcher's machine unless explicitly pointed at a remote
  API.
type: software
